## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a scalable, secure, multi-tenant pipeline with strong data isolation and production-grade reliability.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub and Dataflow streaming with exactly-once processing
- BigQuery per-tenant datasets and Row-Level Security
- CMEK and dedicated service accounts
- Parameterized Dataflow templates and tenant routing
- Global monitoring, cost controls, and regional DR

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Dataflow-like routing (conceptual)
function routeEvent(event) {
  const tenant = event.tenant_id;
  const table = `tenant_${tenant}.telemetry`;
  writeToBigQuery(table, event, insertId = event.event_id + tenant);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test idempotency and deduplication at scale?
- How would you handle late-arriving events and schema evolution in BigQuery?

